    "GDT_FRAME": {
      "description": "GD&T feature control frame per ASME Y14.5. Geometric type covers the 14 ASME-defined characteristics: form (3) / orientation (3) / location (2) / runout (2) / profile (2) / position + concentricity + symmetry. Material modifiers: M (MMC) / L (LMC) / S (RFS).",
